  "fullDescription": "<p>💖 A cozy collection of romantic bookish clipart designed for readers who love romance novels, cozy reading evenings, pink aesthetics, and dreamy book-inspired decor. This set features charming illustrations of books, reading nooks, bookish lifestyle elements, and romantic reader accessories in a soft pastel color palette. Perfect for creating feminine, cozy, and modern book-themed designs.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:</p>\n<p>Reading journals<br>\nBook club printables<br>\nStickers and sticker sheets<br>\nBookish planners<br>\nScrapbooking<br>\nSocial media graphics<br>\nPrint on Demand products</p>\n<p>💖 What’s included:<br>\n– 20 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– Transparent background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n– 20 SVG files</p>\n<p>📚 Included illustrations:<br>\nenchanted rose under glass dome, romance trope book stack with bow, cozy reading nook by the window, book club door entrance, bookish tote bag, pink headphones, reading bath with wine and book, heart-pattern tea mug on stacked books, spicy books club card, neon “Just One More Chapter” sign, pastel romance book collection, moon-themed bedside table, enemies-to-lovers record player, girl reading a book, vintage pink typewriter, reading journal, romance books tote bag with iced coffee, magical open book with flowers, pink rolling book cart, and romance trope book stack.</p>\n<p>🌸 Create cozy reading-themed products, romantic book club merchandise, planner accessories, journal pages, stickers, bookmarks, POD designs, and social media content with this charming collection. Designed for romance readers, book lovers, and anyone who enjoys soft feminine bookish aesthetics filled with cozy vibes and literary charm.</p>",
